# EasyNet Axon / CLI Interface Commit Plan

## Core Invariant

The discriminator is policy ownership, not process persistence.

`axon-runtime` is the Axon protocol reference runtime. It owns Invocation admission, canonical receipt semantics, stream/bidi protocol behavior, verification, and protocol-runtime execution. It must not own EasyNet product policy.

`easynet-daemon` is the EasyNet product/device/Hub runtime. It owns pairing-derived identity, plugin lifecycle, Mission/EAL orchestration, local resources, local versus remote dispatch, session dispatch, device behavior, and Hub behavior.

