## Baseline Caveat

This plan is based on the current working tree. EasyNet-Cli's daemon Invocation migration has been re-confirmed against `main` `6f463c6826dd3ff28d44db91263504d3fbc26023`: `main` still contains the retired JSON-control product path and CLI-owned Invocation semantics, while this branch removes them and pins the boundary with `scripts/check-daemon-invocation-migration.sh`. Before cross-repo release packaging, repeat the same baseline confirmation against the EasyNet backend and EasyNet-Axon release baselines.
